     * BOTH `name="file"; filename="file"` and
     * `Content-Type: application/octet-stream`. This is the cross-language
     * contract already honoured by go/node/java; exercised here on the live
     * BaseApi._buildMultipartBody output via the real uploadPetDocument
     * operation (field name `file`). */
    test('bhv serializationwire 049 multipart raw-bytes part reuses field name as filename and falls back to octet-stream', () async {
      final server = await HttpServer.bind(InternetAddress.loopbackIPv4, 0);
